  "prefLabel": "Elec 401.02 Renewal of Identification Card",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-12-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 401.02 Renewal of Identification Card. The following identification card types shall be renewed on the last day of the month one year from the date the identification card is issued and include the $30.00 renewal fee:\n\n(a) Electrician apprentice; and\n\n(b) High/medium voltage trainee.\n\nSource. #10356, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13, EXPIRES: 12-3-13 (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #10420, eff 9-25-13; ss by #13898, eff 5-4-24 (formerly Elec 401.07)",
